OL,3,GNEWSAHow to visit key Rivals locations
OL,4,Afrom new series
OL,5,
OL,6,FFilming locations that feature in the
OL,7,Fpopular TV series Rivals are once again
OL,8,Fputting the West of England "on the
OL,9,Fmap" as the second season of the
OL,10,FDisney+ drama hits our screens.
OL,12,FThe series, based on one of the late
OL,13,FDame Jilly Cooper's so-called
OL,14,F"bonkbusters", features an all-star
OL,15,Fcast including Aidan Turner, David
OL,16,FTennant and Danny Dyer.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
