OL,3,GNEWSAHow to visit key Rivals locations
OL,4,Afrom new series
OL,5,
OL,6,FFilming for series two took place in
OL,7,Fplaces such as Bristol Harbourside,
OL,8,FCorsham in Wiltshire, Berkeley Castle
OL,9,Fin Gloucestershire and Ammerdown House
OL,10,Fin Somerset, with towns across the
OL,11,Fregion standing in for the Cotswolds
OL,12,Fand London.
OL,14,FMatt Booker runs The Corsham Toy Shop
OL,15,Fand said it was a "bonus" to have
OL,16,FRivals filmed there and brought in
OL,17,F"trade".
